% expect-error: undefined
% divergence: capture-refuses-page-operators
% Scenario: page operators inside a paint procedure raise undefined.
/P << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop showpage } >> matrix makepattern def
P setpattern
100 100 200 100 rectfill
